name: CodeRefactor
description: "Refactor legacy code to meet modern architectural and styling standards."

allowed_data:
  - Target Code Repository
  - Architecture Guidelines
  - Style Guides

allowed_tools:
  - Code Editor
  - Linter
  - Unit Test Runner
  - Internal Search

forbidden:
  - Modification of external APIs
  - Changing business logic
  - Internet Access

validation:
  - Unit tests must pass after refactoring
  - Linter warnings must be zero
  - Code review by a senior developer is required

output: Refactored_Code_Patch.diff
risk_level: MEDIUM
